      "value": "<p><em>(10th Level)</em></p><p><em>“You can’t delete what I’ve backed up.”</em></p><p>If a Precedent would be erased, overwritten, or forgotten, it instead becomes a <strong>Latent Record</strong>.</p><p>Latent Records:</p><ul><li><p>Persist invisibly</p></li><li><p>May be reactivated later at reduced strength</p></li><li><p>Represent buried truth resurfacing</p></li></ul><h3>Cost</h3><p>No Surge required to preserve. Reactivation may require 1 Surge.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Too many Latent Records can destabilize narrative clarity.</p>",
